# Talent OS — keep confidential inputs and generated PII out of git.
# The kit (skills, templates, reference, agents) is safe to commit.
# Anything a client hands you, or anything a skill generates from it, is NOT.

# Real inputs Brandon drops in (interview transcripts, resumes, rosters, survey data)
intake/interviews/*
intake/roles/*
intake/resumes/*
intake/data/*
# ...but keep the folders + their READMEs so the structure ships
!intake/**/README.md
!intake/**/.gitkeep

# Generated deliverables can contain candidate names, comp, PII
deliverables/*
!deliverables/README.md
!deliverables/.gitkeep

# Local scratch / model working notes
.context/
*.local.md

# OS noise
.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log
